# Visual overhaul checklist

This project has a staged visual overhaul. The working checklist is [`VISUAL_OVERHAUL.md`](../../VISUAL_OVERHAUL.md). Token catalog: [`src/theme/tokens.md`](../../src/theme/tokens.md).

When you complete work that matches a checklist item, mark it `[x]` in `VISUAL_OVERHAUL.md` in the same change. Do not restyle product pages until Phase 1–3 required items are done, unless the user explicitly asks to skip ahead.

Appearance must go through CSS variables from the theme registry (`src/theme`) and Tailwind mappings in `tailwind.config.js`. Do not add new raw Tailwind palette colors (`red-500`, `green-50`, `blue-600`, …) for UI chrome, alerts, or status. Do not branch page UI on palette ids; use `data-palette` / CSS variables / `useThemeTokens()`.
